Pursuant to the Law on Juvenile Justice No. 59/2024/QH15, amended by Law No. 85/2025/QH15;
At the request of the Minister of Public Security of Vietnam;

The Government of Vietnam hereby promulgates the Decree elaborating certain community-based diversion measures; responsibilities and procedures for community-based diversion; application of electronic monitoring measures and community reintegration to juvenile delinquents.

Chapter I

GENERAL PROVISIONS

Article 1. Scope

This Decree elaborates on Articles 48, 49, 73, 75, 79, 80, 82, 89, 91, 139, and 173 of the Law on Juvenile Justice No. 59/2024/QH15, amended by Law No. 85/2025/QH15 (hereinafter referred to as “the Law on Juvenile Justice”).

Article 2. Regulated entities

1. Agencies, organizations, individuals, and families involved in the implementation of community-based diversion measures, electronic monitoring (EM) measures, and the provision of support to juveniles for community reintegration.

