The Government hereby promulgates a Decree on amendments to several Articles of the Government’s Decree No. 162/2018/ND-CP dated November 30, 2018 on penalties for administrative civil aviation offences amended by the Government’s Decree No. 123/2021/ND-CP dated December 28, 2021 on amendments to some Articles of Decrees on several articles of decrees providing for penalties for administrative maritime offences;
administrative road traffic offences and rail transport offences; civil aviation offences and Government’s Decree No. 282/2025/ND-CP dated October 30, 2025 providing for penalties for administrative offences in fields of security, social order and safety; social vice prevention and combat; domestic violence prevention and combat (Decree No. 162/2018/ND-CP) regarding power to impose penalties for administrative offences.

Article 1. Amendments to Article 31 of the Decree No. 162/2018/ND-CP

“Article 31. Power to impose penalties of inspectors

1. During the inspection period, inspectors of the Inspectorate of the Ministry of Public Security and Vietnam Aviation Inspectorate have the power to:
a) Issue warnings;

b) Impose a fine of up to VND 10,000,000;

c) Confiscate any exhibit or instrumentality involved in commission of administrative offences if its value is not 02 times as high as the penalty amount specified in point b of this clause.
2. Chiefs of the Vietnam Aviation Inspectorate and Inspectorate of the Fire and Rescue Police Department and provincial Police Departments have the power to:

a) Issue warnings;

b) Impose a fine of up to VND 50,000,000;

c) Confiscate any exhibit or instrumentality involved in commission of administrative offences;
d) Enforce the remedial measures mentioned in clause 3 Article 4 of this Decree.

3. Chief Inspector of the Vietnam Aviation Inspectorate; Chief Inspector of the Inspectorate of the Fire and Rescue Police Department; Chief Inspectors of provincial Police Departments have the power to:

a) Issue warnings;

b) Impose a fine of up to VND 80,000,000;

c) Suspend the license or suspend the operation for a fixed period;
d) Confiscate any exhibit or instrumentality involved in commission of administrative offences;

dd) Enforce the remedial measures mentioned in clause 3 Article 4 of this Decree.

source:
4. Chánh Thanh tra Bộ Công an; Trưởng đoàn thanh tra do Chánh Thanh tra Bộ Công an thành lập trong thời hạn thanh tra có quyền:

a) Phạt cảnh cáo;

b) Phạt tiền đến 100.000.000 đồng;

c) Tước quyền sử dụng giấy phép có thời hạn hoặc đình chỉ hoạt động có thời hạn;
d) Tịch thu tang vật, phương tiện vi phạm hành chính;

đ) Áp dụng biện pháp khắc phục hậu quả quy định tại khoản 3 Điều 4 Nghị định này.”.

