Article 2. Article 31a is added after Article 31 of the Decree No. 162/2018/ND-CP

“Article 31a. Power of heads of agencies performing state management tasks
1. The Director General of the Civil Aviation Authority of Vietnam is entitled to:

a) Issue warnings;

b) Impose a fine of up to VND 100,000,000;
c) Suspend the license or suspend the operation for a fixed period;

d) Confiscate any exhibit or instrumentality involved in commission of administrative offences;
dd) Enforce the remedial measures mentioned in clause 3 Article 4 of this Decree.

2. During the examination period, the head of the examination team established by the Director General of the Civil Aviation Authority of Vietnam is entitled to:
a) Issue warnings;

b) Impose a fine of up to VND 80,000,000;
c) Suspend the license or suspend the operation for a fixed period;

d) Confiscate any exhibit or instrumentality involved in commission of administrative offences;
dd) Enforce the remedial measures mentioned in clause 3 Article 4 of this Decree.

3. During the examination period, the head of the examination team established by the Minister of Construction and the Minister of Public Security is entitled to impose penalties for administrative offences as prescribed in clause 1 of this Article.”.

